{"seq":1,"slug":"alertness-states","title":"警戒状态机：从不知情到战斗","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-stealth-detection-systems/awareness/alertness-states","wordCount":1658,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"警戒状态机-从不知情到战斗\">警戒状态机：从不知情到战斗</h1><p>侦测值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 是一个在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 上连续变化的数，但玩家感受到的不是这个数，而是敌人态度的<strong>阶跃</strong>：那一刻它突然停下、那一刻它拔出了枪、那一刻它喊出了警报。把连续的怀疑程度切分成少数几个离散、可读、可预期的态度，是警戒状态机的职责。它坐在侦测模型（见 <a href=\"../foundations/detection-model\">侦测模型</a>）之上，把一条平滑曲线翻译成一部有清晰章节的小戏剧，让玩家在每个阶段都知道自己处境几何、还剩多少补救余地。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-警戒状态的阶梯\">核心概念：警戒状态的阶梯</h2><p>绝大多数潜行游戏的敌人可以归入四到五个警戒状态，它们沿侦测值从低到高排列。<strong>不知情（Unaware）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 接近 0，敌人执行常规巡逻或待机，对玩家一无所知。<strong>怀疑（Suspicious）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 越过第一道低阈值，敌人察觉到「有点不对」，停步、朝刺激来源张望，但尚未确认。<strong>搜索（Search / Investigate）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 继续上升或怀疑未消解，敌人主动前往可疑位置查看（详见 <a href=\"search-investigate\">搜索与调查</a>）。<strong>警觉（Alert）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 高，敌人确信有入侵者，进入戒备、呼叫同伴（详见 <a href=\"group-coordination\">群体协调</a>）。<strong>战斗（Combat）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 达到或接近 1 且敌人锁定了玩家位置，切换到交战逻辑——此时博弈规则已切换，属于 <a href=\"../../combat-system-design/systems-depth/ai-combat-encounter\">战斗系统 · AI 战斗遭遇</a> 的范畴，本 hub 到此交棒。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  U[不知情&lt;br/&gt;巡逻/待机] --&gt;|D 越过 T_susp| S1[怀疑&lt;br/&gt;停步张望]&#10;  S1 --&gt;|D 越过 T_search| S2[搜索&lt;br/&gt;前往可疑点]&#10;  S2 --&gt;|D 越过 T_alert| A[警觉&lt;br/&gt;戒备/呼叫]&#10;  A --&gt;|锁定位置 D 近 1| C[战斗]&#10;  S1 --&gt;|D 回落且冷却结束| U&#10;  S2 --&gt;|搜索无果且冷却结束| S1&#10;  A --&gt;|失去目标且冷却结束| S2&#10;  C --&gt;|长时间失去目标| A\">flowchart TD\n  U[不知情&lt;br/&gt;巡逻/待机] --&gt;|D 越过 T_susp| S1[怀疑&lt;br/&gt;停步张望]\n  S1 --&gt;|D 越过 T_search| S2[搜索&lt;br/&gt;前往可疑点]\n  S2 --&gt;|D 越过 T_alert| A[警觉&lt;br/&gt;戒备/呼叫]\n  A --&gt;|锁定位置 D 近 1| C[战斗]\n  S1 --&gt;|D 回落且冷却结束| U\n  S2 --&gt;|搜索无果且冷却结束| S1\n  A --&gt;|失去目标且冷却结束| S2\n  C --&gt;|长时间失去目标| A</pre><p>注意图中降级（虚线方向的回落）都附带「冷却结束」条件——态度上升可以由侦测值直接驱动，但下降必须更谨慎，这正是下一节迟滞的意义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"阈值与迟滞-为什么升降不对称\">阈值与迟滞：为什么升降不对称</h2><p>如果每个状态的进入和退出用同一个阈值，会发生灾难性的<strong>状态抖动</strong>：当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 在某个阈值附近微小波动时，敌人在「怀疑」和「不知情」之间每帧反复横跳，动画和音效疯狂闪烁，玩家和 AI 都显得神经质。解决办法是迟滞（hysteresis）——进入和退出用两个不同的阈值。以怀疑状态为例，进入阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mtext>susp</mtext><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">↑</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{susp}}^{\\uparrow}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2322em;vertical-align:-0.3831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">susp</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mrel mtight\">↑</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 高于退出阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mtext>susp</mtext><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">↓</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{susp}}^{\\downarrow}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2322em;vertical-align:-0.3831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">susp</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mrel mtight\">↓</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 必须涨到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mtext>susp</mtext><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">↑</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{susp}}^{\\uparrow}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2322em;vertical-align:-0.3831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">susp</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mrel mtight\">↑</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 才进入怀疑，之后要跌回更低的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mtext>susp</mtext><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">↓</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{susp}}^{\\downarrow}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2322em;vertical-align:-0.3831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">susp</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mrel mtight\">↓</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 才退出。两阈值之间形成一条「死区」，吸收波动，保证状态一旦切换就稳定停留一段。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>进入怀疑：</mtext><mi>D</mi><mo>≥</mo><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mtext>susp</mtext><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">↑</mo></msubsup><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>退出怀疑：</mtext><mi>D</mi><mo>≤</mo><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mtext>susp</mtext><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">↓</mo></msubsup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mtext>susp</mtext><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">↓</mo></msubsup><mo>&lt;</mo><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mtext>susp</mtext><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">↑</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{进入怀疑：} D \\ge T_{\\text{susp}}^{\\uparrow} \\qquad \\text{退出怀疑：} D \\le T_{\\text{susp}}^{\\downarrow}, \\quad T_{\\text{susp}}^{\\downarrow} &lt; T_{\\text{susp}}^{\\uparrow}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">进入怀疑：</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2822em;vertical-align:-0.3831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">susp</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mrel mtight\">↑</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">退出怀疑：</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2822em;vertical-align:-0.3831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">susp</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mrel mtight\">↓</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">susp</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mrel mtight\">↓</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2822em;vertical-align:-0.3831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">susp</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mrel mtight\">↑</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>除了阈值迟滞，降级还常叠加<strong>时间冷却</strong>：即使 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 已回落，敌人也要在当前状态多停留若干秒才降级，模拟「我再看看，说不定还有人」的心理惯性。这段冷却直接决定玩家失误后的紧张持续多久——冷却太短，被惊动的守卫转眼就恢复常态，惊险瞬间被抹平；冷却太长，玩家被迫无所事事地干等，节奏拖沓。它是难度调校的核心旋钮之一（见 <a href=\"../practice/stealth-tuning\">难度调校</a>）。</p>\n<p>下表把典型的状态、进入条件、行为与降级规则汇总。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态</th>\n<th>进入条件</th>\n<th>敌人行为</th>\n<th>降级规则</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>不知情</td>\n<td>初始 / 长时间无刺激</td>\n<td>巡逻、待机、日常动作</td>\n<td>—（最低态）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>怀疑</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>≥</mo><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mtext>susp</mtext><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">↑</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D \\ge T_{\\text{susp}}^{\\uparrow}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2322em;vertical-align:-0.3831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">susp</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mrel mtight\">↑</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>停步、转向刺激源、观察</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>≤</mo><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mtext>susp</mtext><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">↓</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D \\le T_{\\text{susp}}^{\\downarrow}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2322em;vertical-align:-0.3831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">susp</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mrel mtight\">↓</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 且冷却结束 → 不知情</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>搜索</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>≥</mo><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mtext>search</mtext><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">↑</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D \\ge T_{\\text{search}}^{\\uparrow}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2683em;vertical-align:-0.3013em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.967em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3987em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">search</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mrel mtight\">↑</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3013em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 或怀疑未消</td>\n<td>前往可疑点、扩散搜查</td>\n<td>搜索超时无果 + 冷却 → 怀疑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>警觉</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>≥</mo><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mtext>alert</mtext><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">↑</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D \\ge T_{\\text{alert}}^{\\uparrow}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2683em;vertical-align:-0.3013em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.967em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3987em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">alert</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mrel mtight\">↑</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3013em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>戒备、呼叫增援、快速逼近</td>\n<td>失去目标 + 较长冷却 → 搜索</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>战斗</td>\n<td>锁定位置且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D \\approx 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>交战（移交战斗系统）</td>\n<td>长时间失联 → 警觉</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"状态记忆-不只是当前态度\">状态记忆：不只是当前态度</h2><p>一个只记「当前状态」的状态机会显得健忘：玩家刚把守卫从警觉逗回不知情，转身又出现，守卫却像第一次见面一样毫无戒心。真实感来自<strong>状态记忆</strong>——敌人应记录「最近是否被惊动过」，并让被惊动过的敌人在一段时间内保持更高的基础警觉（例如更低的进入阈值、更快的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 上升、或一个不归零的侦测地板，见 <a href=\"../foundations/detection-model\">侦测模型</a> 的衰减地板）。这样第二次接触会更快升级，玩家能感觉到「这片区域已经被我搅动过，敌人变精了」，符合直觉也提升了连续失误的代价。</p>\n<p>状态记忆还包括对<strong>线索</strong>的记忆：发现的尸体、被打开的门、消失的物品都应把附近敌人的基础警觉抬高，甚至直接推入搜索。这类线索使玩家的扰动筹码有了长期后果，也让「清理现场」成为有意义的操作，是系统化潜行（如 Hitman、Dishonored）深度的来源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"状态机的实现选择-fsm-还是行为树\">状态机的实现选择：FSM 还是行为树</h2><p>警戒状态本质上是一个有限状态机，用经典 FSM 实现直观且够用——每个状态一个节点，转移条件挂在边上。这套模式的通用实现见 <a href=\"../../game-ai/decision-systems/finite-state-machine\">游戏 AI · 有限状态机</a>。但当每个状态内部的行为变复杂（搜索状态要巡查多个点、警觉状态要协调找掩体和呼叫），纯 FSM 的状态内逻辑会膨胀。此时常见做法是<strong>分层</strong>：外层用 FSM 管警戒态度的切换，每个状态内部用行为树（见 <a href=\"../../game-ai/decision-systems/behavior-tree\">游戏 AI · 行为树</a>）组织具体动作。这种「FSM 管态度、行为树管执行」的分工，让警戒逻辑与行为逻辑各自独立演化，是中大型项目的主流架构。</p>\n<p>无论用哪种，都要守住一条原则：状态切换必须由侦测值这一单一真相源驱动，不要在多处各自判断「是否发现玩家」，否则会出现态度、动画、音效三者不一致的 bug。侦测值 → 状态 → 行为 → 反馈这条单向链路（见 <a href=\"../foundations/stealth-pillars\">潜行三支柱</a>）必须保持清晰。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>警戒状态机把连续的侦测值切成不知情/怀疑/搜索/警觉/战斗的离散阶梯，让敌人态度可读、可预期。</li>\n<li>迟滞（进入阈值高于退出阈值）加时间冷却，消除状态抖动并塑造失误后的紧张时长，是核心调校旋钮。</li>\n<li>状态记忆让被惊动过的敌人保持更高基础警觉、记住线索（尸体/开门/失物），使连续失误有累积代价。</li>\n<li>实现上小项目用纯 FSM，大项目分层为「FSM 管态度 + 行为树管执行」；态度必须由侦测值单一真相源驱动。</li>\n<li>战斗状态是本 hub 的交棒点，此后规则切换到战斗系统。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>状态背后的连续量：<a href=\"../foundations/detection-model\">侦测模型</a>；怀疑/搜索态的具体行为：<a href=\"search-investigate\">搜索与调查</a></li>\n<li>状态机的通用实现：<a href=\"../../game-ai/decision-systems/finite-state-machine\">游戏 AI · 有限状态机</a></li>\n<li>交棒后的战斗逻辑：<a href=\"../../combat-system-design/systems-depth/ai-combat-encounter\">战斗系统设计 · AI 战斗遭遇</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"警戒状态机：从不知情到战斗","id":"警戒状态机-从不知情到战斗"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：警戒状态的阶梯","id":"核心概念-警戒状态的阶梯"},{"level":2,"text":"阈值与迟滞：为什么升降不对称","id":"阈值与迟滞-为什么升降不对称"},{"level":2,"text":"状态记忆：不只是当前态度","id":"状态记忆-不只是当前态度"},{"level":2,"text":"状态机的实现选择：FSM 还是行为树","id":"状态机的实现选择-fsm-还是行为树"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"可见度与光影：玩家有多「显眼」","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-stealth-detection-systems/perception/visibility-light"},"next":{"title":"搜索与调查：失误之后的第二回合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-stealth-detection-systems/awareness/search-investigate"}}